{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 421, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457798754309", "sourceSha256": "638ec5f163f8c645f527c96d40fc8040b2430b17c813a9a63e6c17814cf4db94", "targetSha256": "8e9667b23a72f61deab388af6612f83c89d05462ea3b18c480238396fb0f3b80", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_6"], "source": "Разбирайтесь сами", "target": "Vyřešte si to sami"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 422, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457798754308", "sourceSha256": "a22bfeb17c5b00cdbfe5aa9a8bbe599a80231ef26ff9df6129e9dcc3005fc176", "targetSha256": "b7d4efd8d4d9696f9b33f051532b8e6fce15a44653c1c25a0b8571d65d1897cf", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_6"], "source": "Phone: Ноги есть у неё? В чём проблема?", "target": "Phone: Nohy snad má, ne? Tak v čem je problém?"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 423, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457798754307", "sourceSha256": "1f12f230528e804786f8c6e0b95348effa15f0c9d9ed9a33fc845f78b14698a8", "targetSha256": "1aec40bd110d2f23f7b1c77973464345043784e3bb6d0c3cb955fa7870ec419f", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_6"], "source": "Phone: Да пусть сама придёт. Не принцесса же.", "target": "Phone: Ať si přijde sama. Není to žádná princezna."}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 424, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457798754306", "sourceSha256": "741a831e67342b52c9dd467a861a193b1df198b39a7a43bb7de4235cc1dad062", "targetSha256": "560ea9684e5dad576dbb93b5f1ed76a73f40b8f791318a4c60e911a19d23231b", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_5"], "source": "Короче, скажу, что ты жив и ждёшь", "target": "Zkrátka jí řeknu, že jsi naživu a čekáš"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 425, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457798754305", "sourceSha256": "638ec5f163f8c645f527c96d40fc8040b2430b17c813a9a63e6c17814cf4db94", "targetSha256": "8e9667b23a72f61deab388af6612f83c89d05462ea3b18c480238396fb0f3b80", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_5"], "source": "Разбирайтесь сами", "target": "Vyřešte si to sami"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 426, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457798754304", "sourceSha256": "4bf790c4aaf8729dc7366a20d9be050405ce3b6efacf90f3c8e8f60c24df2116", "targetSha256": "371eafb37fb9150679d7c41be506d83af87ec62ce5b5831dcbfd6bde67d158e5", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_5"], "source": "Phone: Пусть она сходит. Скажите ей, что она за мать такая?", "target": "Phone: Ať si tam zajde ona. Řekněte jí, co je to za matku."}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 427, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457794560012", "sourceSha256": "941e254a21675dddd49bc191944559a71cc1598d6d3ee984e4759448366bb094", "targetSha256": "a309f97c7d09a7d26731f1c32427f66b00e29400e7e44e9ac0298fbbc65669c0", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_5"], "source": "Phone: Я ж к ней не пойду.", "target": "Phone: Já k ní nepůjdu."}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 428, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457794560011", "sourceSha256": "ef427383ba103f889af04e730a41ecfbf388148f649068c729f78bba1a5cf30b", "targetSha256": "71a53699b430fa52b59acc42e211d9964181fbce4b90c9a7bbd435c4e4ecb2f8", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_5"], "source": "Phone: Ну, может, они там.", "target": "Phone: No, možná jsou tam."}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 429, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457794560010", "sourceSha256": "e8b9c82339a3e20f88c9d957d862b9923e5d390fbe7539ecbc777e1d4e2f43f9", "targetSha256": "fb01a372d93e795c624be5854734640f13fe484f5edf1634d8c3bbf980d28edd", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_5"], "source": "Phone: Угу.", "target": "Phone: Jo."}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 430, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457794560009", "sourceSha256": "7e409864471258faaae86f4fa320c295840e7bbd8cce2c783082009923e87411", "targetSha256": "2230455b952da880a19d48d824e6c780e5b7a24b741617acea627f05fed35fd7", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_4"], "source": "Может, заберёте её отсюда?", "target": "Nemohl byste ji odsud odvést?"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 431, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457794560008", "sourceSha256": "43e5ab70f691a6a6391be1da21bc18c31c04892ceb19fde88e44ad50c5ec9052", "targetSha256": "38cebf4836a918cb5a42873deff4065fe36689cbfd0a3e862ede3ebff766807e", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-003.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_4"], "source": "Нет", "target": "Ne"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 432, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457794560007", "sourceSha256": "81c613919663434679d023e6cf6e1b2c4f2636bb6b99fdb0b9a78c7aab617b03", "targetSha256": "a408bfb7a645316047abd3e89a08b25521091dd16e4c8ec662798e0452010277", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_4"], "source": "Phone: У матери жены искали?", "target": "Phone: Hledali jste u matky mé ženy?"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 433, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457794560006", "sourceSha256": "0411c629817809fb12a8aecc8526bf80cdb608bc8dc81b51295446480275d9ef", "targetSha256": "7d0a65dd8a29905fb66eacbb7319c9073fa4cf4e1330315af0c0607d68051ad3", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_4"], "source": "Phone: Я не удивлён.", "target": "Phone: To mě nepřekvapuje."}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 434, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457794560005", "sourceSha256": "2940ec2ddf12847db120e4bdffac2679e1172a6daf71422f97190db0ddf1d360", "targetSha256": "f1fe9968b56de25c0474b9c0971e23df5e088190948221aaa555f674e0169438", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_4"], "source": "Phone: Нет. А они не с ней?", "target": "Phone: Ne. Nejsou snad s ní?"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 435, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457794560004", "sourceSha256": "7e409864471258faaae86f4fa320c295840e7bbd8cce2c783082009923e87411", "targetSha256": "2230455b952da880a19d48d824e6c780e5b7a24b741617acea627f05fed35fd7", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_3"], "source": "Может, заберёте её отсюда?", "target": "Nemohl byste ji odsud odvést?"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 436, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457794560003", "sourceSha256": "43e5ab70f691a6a6391be1da21bc18c31c04892ceb19fde88e44ad50c5ec9052", "targetSha256": "38cebf4836a918cb5a42873deff4065fe36689cbfd0a3e862ede3ebff766807e", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-003.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_3"], "source": "Нет", "target": "Ne"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 437, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457794560002", "sourceSha256": "81c613919663434679d023e6cf6e1b2c4f2636bb6b99fdb0b9a78c7aab617b03", "targetSha256": "a408bfb7a645316047abd3e89a08b25521091dd16e4c8ec662798e0452010277", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_3"], "source": "Phone: У матери жены искали?", "target": "Phone: Hledali jste u matky mé ženy?"}
