{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 439, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457794560000", "sourceSha256": "c1de3e8bc092eece4c9bca929f3fac219db3a5aa3a4879f5d3d81c9b0dbab99a", "targetSha256": "f5a2b1e083e8af8ae37eaca7397e602dc5635ad0bda87520e78397cf92f7056c", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_3"], "source": "Phone: Оооооой. Опять ей похер на своих же детей.", "target": "Phone: No tááák. Zase má svoje vlastní děti úplně na háku."}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 440, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457790365707", "sourceSha256": "d9ab199ade074b336ee6cf08177940c1e70b31f3d8b47fc556e5a8566d8ae7c3", "targetSha256": "55ea521af28875886eebf45c09b1769a2c89b6947441921dc4126fd0e97fe0bd", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_2"], "source": "Дети у вас?", "target": "Máte děti u sebe?"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 441, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457790365706", "sourceSha256": "7926fb37cb1e4ae45de803db63a03542134b64d06b3b8ea4443a2b34d2f90af9", "targetSha256": "f3d6d2dfda8d661c922e802eac430b2f846f240deb10b020c4716355d410bdae", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_2"], "source": "Она потеряла всех детей", "target": "Přišla o všechny děti"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 442, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457790365705", "sourceSha256": "1364dc5b014ae71f8cd26c38a1bd9c2d2cb4f12943f70b3e3cb1bf30d0dfdd6b", "targetSha256": "2c44493f3e52b315f4c1227915383d4726ed07ba53a9d37eecd4db79ad61322c", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_2"], "source": "Phone: Ничего нового.", "target": "Phone: Nic nového."}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 443, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457790365704", "sourceSha256": "3e45e432a6af7a73c0ff5cde4a72fbd7ad0bef138f1b7b5568443269404fa93f", "targetSha256": "42cdf7f0eed1591660e1627089c0a1d317be1e718083cfd1929762fee74decc2", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_2"], "source": "Phone: Сама сидит — «ой, я устала».", "target": "Phone: Jen sedí a říká: «Ach, já jsem unavená.»"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 444, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457790365703", "sourceSha256": "7ce7a04b7c73ebcba2c85c9d6c325c549e18264ac1318a3bb1f0b73862b5f38f", "targetSha256": "f1883c07e29edf4f521e4d14b321fa9acfb82e486b550b1ebeaf937770ecb762", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_2"], "source": "Phone: Как обычно. Постоянно только я должен всё решать.", "target": "Phone: Jako vždycky. Pořád musím všechno řešit jenom já."}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 445, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457790365702", "sourceSha256": "d9ab199ade074b336ee6cf08177940c1e70b31f3d8b47fc556e5a8566d8ae7c3", "targetSha256": "55ea521af28875886eebf45c09b1769a2c89b6947441921dc4126fd0e97fe0bd", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_1"], "source": "Дети у вас?", "target": "Máte děti u sebe?"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 446, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457790365701", "sourceSha256": "7926fb37cb1e4ae45de803db63a03542134b64d06b3b8ea4443a2b34d2f90af9", "targetSha256": "f3d6d2dfda8d661c922e802eac430b2f846f240deb10b020c4716355d410bdae", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_1"], "source": "Она потеряла всех детей", "target": "Přišla o všechny děti"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 447, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457790365700", "sourceSha256": "ca2b35f04597d8eb2b0edabe4bdea166907955f585f085e93ffab29abcfc199c", "targetSha256": "8e5ede031893fef8d7576f23c41485d2a3149b1eeb9f0d270f71b5d326cc2f0b", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband_1"], "source": "Phone: Угу, и чё?", "target": "Phone: No jo, a co?"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 448, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457790365699", "sourceSha256": "4e7a69b80e9a0dacf0a4460ed0b388af39b3deedea76caa5af827ae7b04e7129", "targetSha256": "aff07d8f92b6857c2a352931c4e06a75ac642d30f948ff8fd0241d83b032fd97", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband"], "source": "Вашей жене нужна помощь", "target": "Vaše žena potřebuje pomoc"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 449, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457790365698", "sourceSha256": "b3d14da72eac3eba3cd2d39fd438e9cc1cab512f9d8753c74d587af0eb7c3987", "targetSha256": "b3df6be968df48fb773292690e5d7915fbb462661d7543721a75e92b7a63c5fb", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband"], "source": "Ваша жена дала мне этот номер", "target": "Vaše žena mi dala tohle číslo"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 450, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457790365697", "sourceSha256": "6d0815c8c012807eac813cf0be19c8e41778153fccfcdf96585a859492285b79", "targetSha256": "ee227d58e8efbf24fb5a8e1e7f9bbc42cd8faf715b663b8f94ef2013109804ac", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-013.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_mothershusband"], "source": "Phone: А? Алё?", "target": "Phone: Co? Haló?"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 451, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457790365696", "sourceSha256": "e0a4330c4572ad65ebe6475c8c5a5fb540ca02e3d9f1fa8a0977e0aa563a672d", "targetSha256": "adbdea3777eb5f23eb987cf102624fb52a8232a9873939efa4d97081d3175205", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-014.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["tv_7_necessary"], "source": "TV: Далее репортаж о том, кто такие Гости.", "target": "TV: Následuje reportáž o tom, kdo jsou Hosté."}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 452, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457786171403", "sourceSha256": "80b3972d64424969492fac67423c606f1cd0b5bd0a1e7951017fd18a0940a91c", "targetSha256": "1165c3283ce2d610f2e1273ac87d64ae7a17f6cf49bbc49e28b549114ccb31ad", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-014.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["tv_6_necessary"], "source": "TV: КЧС сообщили о новом признаке Гостей...", "target": "TV: KČS oznámil nový znak Hostů…"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 453, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457786171402", "sourceSha256": "d6645c1c410ae904f3ca76c635f6ce6771348179c937deb39ece5d6c621eedc6", "targetSha256": "870d84c8c94bd0510f9ac41c4802c7c68b5d98aa38abee1793272aa6436ce3e4", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-014.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["tv_6_necessary"], "source": "TV: Несмотря на пожары, Гости продолжают терроризировать население.", "target": "TV: Navzdory požárům Hosté dál terorizují obyvatelstvo."}
