{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 488, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457773588489", "sourceSha256": "63de74bbda6c85024e33e934fff8eda592db2b8e33fe7632523f1414acd002a0", "targetSha256": "2abf5e6d14a407b482c1082181d26f01c0e571933aa7b8cf0d242a5442119fca", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-015.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_psychics_9"], "source": "Phone: Лучше обратитесь к экзорцистам, они вам помогут.", "target": "Phone: Raději se obraťte na exorcisty, ti vám pomohou."}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 489, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457773588488", "sourceSha256": "cdb56d421f5610e3fa08151570251cd939dbcdb8db4224544c31bd8b7808d91b", "targetSha256": "474af3b76fc2f84a85cdd75946875f3aaff8a0b3ddefdb39696407925a14fd9b", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-015.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_psychics_9"], "source": "Phone: Эх, вот досада – изгнание духов умерших не по нашей части.", "target": "Phone: Ach, to je škoda. Vymítání duchů zemřelých nepatří do naší práce."}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 490, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457773588487", "sourceSha256": "4e3879b51423ecab7f53bdf727f330cd1de75664c20ef5ded68fca73dbfcbc5d", "targetSha256": "2ca00077549d107bfcffc6de4ab1ac90ffb41a9b61cb221a50ff8aa920fbd932", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-015.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_psychics_9"], "source": "Phone: У вас не Гостевой, а Духовой. Дух мёртвого человека.", "target": "Phone: Nemáte Hostovce, ale Duchovce. Ducha mrtvého člověka."}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 491, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457773588486", "sourceSha256": "687f2f2a29b1e4b855fb2ba5b2d6862b0c94dbfca9275388f6077009d753930c", "targetSha256": "a3616398e0f48523a154db9fe97b25115cdead1b1049990e58a3db4be092d6bd", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-015.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_psychics_9"], "source": "Phone: А, ну тогда мне всё понятно…", "target": "Phone: Aha, tak teď už je mi všechno jasné…"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 492, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457773588485", "sourceSha256": "43e5ab70f691a6a6391be1da21bc18c31c04892ceb19fde88e44ad50c5ec9052", "targetSha256": "38cebf4836a918cb5a42873deff4065fe36689cbfd0a3e862ede3ebff766807e", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-003.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_psychics_8"], "source": "Нет", "target": "Ne"}
