{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 494, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457773588483", "sourceSha256": "5aee8821efa2e3e88176e4c08980c9d951a4c974023b0b550b96e23c950277b8", "targetSha256": "d5c1dfdf2f888aff64beadf1989a42fc40923cf872a4ac83581afddb2ff5dd82", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-015.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_psychics_8"], "source": "Phone: Ух, непросто, непросто…", "target": "Phone: Uf, to není snadné, vůbec ne…"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 495, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457773588482", "sourceSha256": "7b2f66d649cd9d57c84ec9eb267bc3e8e7e5ef04cbef70c0b6d2f12c9d1c58c1", "targetSha256": "7b2f66d649cd9d57c84ec9eb267bc3e8e7e5ef04cbef70c0b6d2f12c9d1c58c1", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-015.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_psychics_8"], "source": "Phone: …", "target": "Phone: …"}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 496, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457773588481", "sourceSha256": "370de08f73cdc4ae166ecc615b859fbc8efe6f0b115bf73a65943ca50de75390", "targetSha256": "6c6defbb6d5c5ffd79ae6b0513cd8e9ef42e448563ad7247f56ea44bb85b69f8", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-015.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_psychics_8"], "source": "Phone: Если бы вы его пили, внутри мог прорасти мицелий, и начать контролировать вас, словно марионетку.", "target": "Phone: Kdybyste ji pil, mohlo by vám uvnitř vyrůst mycelium a ovládat vás jako loutku."}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 497, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457773588480", "sourceSha256": "47c37493e5b470b579b99ea30e46815fd316b93579fbc87a1ad67f511df5d6ef", "targetSha256": "b191a1c89ead6ac8c2912ac73440db17b4429ec51475252028a25007a4f450a4", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-015.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_psychics_8"], "source": "Phone: Хорошо. Вот и не пейте. Иначе Гостевому будет проще возвращаться в ваше тело.", "target": "Phone: Dobře. A nepijte ji. Jinak se Hostovec snáze vrátí do vašeho těla."}
{"collection": "Dialogs", "sourceIndex": 498, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457769394187", "sourceSha256": "43e5ab70f691a6a6391be1da21bc18c31c04892ceb19fde88e44ad50c5ec9052", "targetSha256": "38cebf4836a918cb5a42873deff4065fe36689cbfd0a3e862ede3ebff766807e", "authoredFile": "Translations/cs/dialogue-batch-003.json", "status": "reviewed-pass", "nodeNames": ["phone_psychics_7"], "source": "Нет", "target": "Ne"}
